  "goodToKnow": "Die Erzeugung is production or generation: die Stromerzeugung (power generation), die Erzeugung von Lebensmitteln. In 2023, renewables generated more than half of Germany's electricity for the first time. Erzeugen means to produce or create, also feelings: Druck erzeugen. Der Erzeuger is a producer, especially a farmer (vom Erzeuger, direct from the farm), and jokingly a biological father. Plural: die Erzeugungen."
